### Run with a REST client extension. Copy the token and IDs from login / fixtures.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOGIN_TOKEN
@company = 1
@fixture = 1
@prediction = 1

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@bolum.test","password":"password123"}

### Paginated fixtures
GET {{base}}/fixtures?per_page=2&upcoming=1
Accept: application/json

### Invalid fixture: same team on both sides
PATCH {{base}}/fixtures/{{fixture}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"home_team_id":1,"away_team_id":1}

### Queue prediction; repeat to demonstrate idempotency
POST {{base}}/companies/{{company}}/fixtures/{{fixture}}/predictions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: example-prediction-001
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Read status after running the queue worker
GET {{base}}/companies/{{company}}/predictions/{{prediction}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Latest completed result
GET {{base}}/companies/{{company}}/fixtures/{{fixture}}/predictions/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Credit ledger
GET {{base}}/companies/{{company}}/credits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Owner-only demo top-up
POST {{base}}/companies/{{company}}/credits/top-ups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: example-topup-001
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":20}

### Company isolation: seeded admin is not a member of company 2
GET {{base}}/companies/2/predictions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Revoke this token
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Provider usage (admin)
GET {{base}}/providers/usage?days=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Queue fixture synchronization (requires server-side football-data.org token)
POST {{base}}/fixtures/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Record a final score (admin; kickoff must be in the past)
PUT {{base}}/fixtures/{{fixture}}/result
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"home_goals":2,"away_goals":1}

### Evaluate frozen pre-kickoff sample predictions
GET {{base}}/companies/{{company}}/performance?quality=sample
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
